arnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DOC 2024 Q3","e":"doc","d":"2024-10-25","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Brinker","x":"Last evening, we increased guidance for the third time this year, driven by outperformance in leasing, same-store operations and merger synergies.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DOC 2024 Q4","e":"doc","d":"2025-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Peter Scott","x":"I mean we feel like we're starting to gain some more pricing power within the market.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DOC 2024 Q4","e":"doc","d":"2025-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Peter Scott","x":"Remember, a lot of our deals are done with existing tenants as well and tenants that typically have existing lease term, which gives us some additional pricing power as well.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DOC 2025 Q1","e":"doc","d":"2025-04-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kelvin Moses","x":"Biopharma is one of them, whether it's tariffs or capital raising or regulatory uncertainty.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DOC 2025 Q1","e":"doc","d":"2025-04-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Bohn","x":"Yes, I would also add it's less about kind of Liberation Day and the tariffs than it is about the -- just the uncertainty and instability to NIH funding and the FDA more so than tariffs that’s what we’re looking at.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DOC 2025 Q1","e":"doc","d":"2025-04-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kelvin Moses","x":"The strength of this diversified portfolio reinforces our ability to maintain guidance and allows us to direct our business strategy towards initiatives that will provide the greatest long-term value to the company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DOC 2025 Q1","e":"doc","d":"2025-04-25","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Brinker","x":"Kelvin will cover guidance in more detail, but I want to comment that maintaining guidance against this market backdrop is a testament to our diversified high quality portfolio.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DOC 2025 Q2","e":"doc","d":"2025-07-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Brinker","x":"So the leasing momentum there is still really strong, good pricing power, good expense control.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/healthpeak-doc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2025 Q2","e":"doc","d":"2025-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kelvin Moses","x":"These tools will empower our team with real-time insights and will allow us to implement solutions that ensure consistent performance, deliver practical efficiencies, and streamline processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/healthpeak-doc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2025 Q4","e":"doc","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kelvin Moses","x":"A component of the strategy is the acceleration of corporate automation which will streamline our internal workflows and deliver a best-in-class experience to our clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/healthpeak-doc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2025 Q4","e":"doc","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Brinker","x":"…if you look at this for the commissioner speaking, they're talking about process improvements and streamlining reviews and lowering costs, which are all changes helpful changes to the industry, which you know, again, isn't directly correlated to capital markets, but, you know, certainly helping…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/healthpeak-doc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2026 Q1","e":"doc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kelvin Moses","x":"But we are certainly pleased with the opportunity to raise guidance $0.01 here and the success of the Janus Living IPO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/healthpeak-doc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2026 Q1","e":"doc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Goldsmith","x":"Just on the guidance, you raised the full year outlook by $0.01.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/healthpeak-doc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2026 Q2","e":"doc","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Bohn","x":"And your question on pricing power, we talked about it a lot, but our portfolio of scale, especially in markets like Bay Area or Torrey allow us to see a lot of deals that aren't widely marketed, whether those are just relationships we have with tenants within the portfolio or otherwise or the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/healthpeak-properties-doc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2026 Q2","e":"doc","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Bohn","x":"So we tend to have a little bit more pricing power on deals like that than you would on widely marketed deal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/healthpeak-properties-doc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2026 Q3","e":"doc","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Scott Brinker","x":"The robust infrastructure of a lab building is attractive to AI-adjacent users, including robotics, because of power, floor loads, and ceiling heights.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/healthpeak-doc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOC 2026 Q3","e":"doc","d":"2026-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Bohn","x":"San Diego, as Scott menti